# M0 migration anchors — these contain REAL customer data (37 of the 40 exported
# customers carry an email address, plus their loyalty metafield values). The
# anchor is the migration rollback artefact and must be copied off the machine to
# secure storage, NEVER committed to the repository.
docs/ops/m0-anchor-production/
docs/ops/m0-anchor-*/
**/m0-metafield-export-*.json
